    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Spiders live in a happy home.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a story of real life horrors mixed with supernatural. In this prologue, you play as Emily, whose life is about to change in a way that no one could have predicted. Dive into an intriguing story with amazing hand-drawn visuals in this mix of a text-based game and 2D exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin a new mystery</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make decisions while progressing through the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Emily's home</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight things that scare you with a flashlight</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Just a bite</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The prologue will take approximately 10-20 minutes to play, depending on your reading speed. It is an introduction to a longer story, although the future of the game is still uncertain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >First project</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a student project created as a part of a course at JAMK University of Applied Sciences. This was the first full game project for everyone in the team, and was made in approximately 9 weeks. Any and all feedback is welcome!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Spiders live in a happy home.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a story of real life horrors mixed with supernatural. In this prologue, you play as Emily, whose life is about to change in a way that no one could have predicted. Dive into an intriguing story with amazing hand-drawn visuals in this mix of a text-based game and 2D exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin a new mystery</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make decisions while progressing through the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Emily's home</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight things that scare you with a flashlight</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Just a bite</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The prologue will take approximately 10-20 minutes to play, depending on your reading speed. It is an introduction to a longer story, although the future of the game is still uncertain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >First project</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a student project created as a part of a course at JAMK University of Applied Sciences. This was the first full game project for everyone in the team, and was made in approximately 9 weeks. Any and all feedback is welcome!</p>",
